    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What remains when everything falls apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Comes After is an episodic VR narrative experience set in the ruins of a forgotten settlement, abandoned by the world, but not by those who still call it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for VR, the game invites you to walk, interact, and slowly rebuild, not just structures, but the fragile connections between people. Each episode brings new stories to uncover, new survivors to meet, and meaningful choices that shape the future of the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no sprawling maps or endless combat here. Instead, every corner holds a memory, every voice tells a story, and every tool, no matter how small, can change someone's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Connect. Endure. Discover what comes after.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What remains when everything falls apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Comes After is an episodic VR narrative experience set in the ruins of a forgotten settlement, abandoned by the world, but not by those who still call it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for VR, the game invites you to walk, interact, and slowly rebuild, not just structures, but the fragile connections between people. Each episode brings new stories to uncover, new survivors to meet, and meaningful choices that shape the future of the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no sprawling maps or endless combat here. Instead, every corner holds a memory, every voice tells a story, and every tool, no matter how small, can change someone's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Connect. Endure. Discover what comes after.</p>",
